15. Conclusion

Following this guide prepares a Kali Linux environment for building and running the Moderated LMS. The exact build and test outcome depends on the source code, CMake configuration and installed dependencies. Installation of the tools does not by itself prove that the application compiles, runs correctly or passes its tests; those activities must be performed and checked separately.
